                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df30e79d-fad2-3b6c-b1da-72f94665effa",
                        "entry_id": "3b198ad9-8bfe-3462-bf18-92fbeff4ebe7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. аппарат, используемый при дефектоскопии"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d49c87e1-a0ac-4e48-a9d6-9ea97753c91e",
                                "sense_id": "df30e79d-fad2-3b6c-b1da-72f94665effa",
                                "text": "Автогаз представил дефектоскопическое оборудование ― магнитный стресс-коррозионный дефектоскоп КОД-4М-1420, предназначенный для диагностики и контроля магистральных газопроводов диаметром 1420 мм в среде транспортирующего продукта."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8984d9c6-7b68-426d-95e2-ae2df1770470",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b198ad9-8bfe-3462-bf18-92fbeff4ebe7",
                        "source_sense_id": "df30e79d-fad2-3b6c-b1da-72f94665effa",
                        "target_lang_word": "defectoscope",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "defectoscope",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50c170e9-b07c-3264-bee0-824a03c263cb",
                                        "entry_id": "c2c9b278-c750-3e03-bc4d-7a10080d5a74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various devices for detecting defects or irregularities in materials that are not visible to the naked eye."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d252087-1650-4135-973b-7e25b2bf8ba0",
                                                "sense_id": "50c170e9-b07c-3264-bee0-824a03c263cb",
                                                "text": "The gamma defectoscope must have a sign indicating the type and intesnsity of the gamma source, and there must be a lock and key so that the source can be locked up, the aim being that the radioisotope should not be handled by irresponsible persons;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "195dcead-f904-4d5a-8a1a-7ba6e78cec84",
                                                "sense_id": "50c170e9-b07c-3264-bee0-824a03c263cb",
                                                "text": "We employed a UDL-02M laser-ultrasonic defectoscope operating in a pulse-echo mode."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaaf0777-2841-4ff7-a841-f776cd6c8d7c",
                                                "sense_id": "50c170e9-b07c-3264-bee0-824a03c263cb",
                                                "text": "Traffic safety is very important, so ropes are routinely controlled by a suitable type of defectoscope."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
